am | Dubai Influencer","format":"video","caption":"Not every buffet is worth the hype... but this one definitely is. 🍣✨ \n\nUnlimited sushi, hot pot, and authentic Japanese flavours for just AED 139. \n\nFresh ingredients, plenty of variety, and a dining experience that’s perfect for date nights, family dinners, or catching up with friends. \n\nDefinitely one to save for your next foodie outing! ❤️\n\n📍 @kaguradxbuae 💯👍🏻\n\n#DubaiFood #JapaneseFoodDubai #SushiDubai #DubaiRestaurants #VisitDubai\n\n(Dubai food influencer, Dubai food blogger, Japanese restaurant Dubai, Unlimited sushi Dubai, Hot pot Dubai, Best Japanese restaurant Dubai, Sushi buffet Dubai, Dubai restaurant review, Dubai foodie, Best food in Dubai, Restaurant collaboration Dubai, Food collaboration UAE, Hospitality collaboration UAE, Luxury dining Dubai, Dubai content creator, UAE lifestyle influencer, Explore Dubai, Hidden gems Dubai, Fine dining Dubai, Food reels UAE)","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_4e2d6c42338ffed1ee1bfee8b8be","publishedAt":"2026-07-02T12:18:57.000Z","profileId":"prf_264d28bc5a6fecafe8a8264482eb","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DaSj3u6q9z5/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":1828520,"likesCount":74256,"sharesCount":909,"commentsCount":68,"interactionsCount":75233,"engagementRatePerViews":4.114420405573907,"engagementRatePerFollowers":6.775373315117495,"profileFollowersCount":1110389,"profileFollowingCount":1455,"profilePostsCount":1971,"mediaCount":1,"duration":39.366,"hashtags":["#japanesefooddubai","#visitdubai","#dubaifood","#dubairestaurants","#sushidubai"],"coAuthors":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"kaguradxbuae"}],"mentions":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"kaguradxbuae"}],"platformId":"DaSj3u6q9z5","profilePlatformId":"631497769","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/lavanyavikram_/pfp.webp","profileBio":"Founder @blushncurls.dubai \n🎥Licensed Content Creator \nStyle Icon2024  \n👉🏼Awards-Filmfare InfluentialWomen2025 Global50Women \nPress @khaleejtimes More","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":"136334756408462","locationCompleteAddress":"International City Dubai","locationLatitude":25.228077,"locationLongitude":55.328213,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"Wait, unlimited sushi and Japanese hot pot for just $81.39? I actually had to see it for myself, it's totally worth it or not. So let me take you through. This hidden Japanese pot is becoming everyone's latest food obsession. And I can totally see why. From unlimited fresh sushi and salmon sashimi to lamb rolls, fresh seafood, hot pot and made to order grilled skewers. There's so much to enjoy. My only advice, go hungry. You will definitely want to try a bit of everything. Check the caption for all the details.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.006,"endSeconds":4.626,"text":"Wait, unlimited sushi and Japanese hot pot for just $81.39?"},{"startSeconds":5.226,"endSeconds":8.666,"text":"I actually had to see it for myself, it's totally worth it or not."},{"startSeconds":8.906,"endSeconds":9.886,"text":"So let me take you through."},{"startSeconds":10.406,"endSeconds":14.546,"text":"This hidden Japanese pot is becoming everyone's latest food obsession."},{"startSeconds":14.966,"endSeconds":16.426,"text":"And I can totally see why."},{"startSeconds":16.786,"endSeconds":26.026,"text":"From unlimited fresh sushi and salmon sashimi to lamb rolls, fresh seafood, hot pot and made to order grilled skewers."},{"startSeconds":26.366,"endSeconds":27.586,"text":"There's so much to enjoy."},{"startSeconds":27.586,"endSeconds":29.786,"text":"My only advice, go hungry."},{"startSeconds":29.946,"endSeconds":32.246,"text":"You will definitely want to try a bit of everything."},{"startSeconds":32.646,"endSeconds":34.506,"text"